save(155,dict(paragraphs=["Kedar Mishra is an Odia poet, translator, editor and art critic from Sonepur. His work extends into journalism and writing on classical dance and music. His poetry collections include Raga Kedar and Premara Dura Geeta; the Kalinga Literary Festival also records his work as a scriptwriter for Odissi performances.","In ‘ଆଖି : ସତ୍ୟାଗ୍ରହ’, his Kabita Live contribution, a beloved’s eyes become a refuge amid images of war, tears and defeat. The poem draws on the Mahabharata’s dice game and eighteen-day battle, then moves towards shelter, love and nonviolent resistance. Its intimate address allows tenderness and protest to inhabit the same poem."],sources=[source('Kalinga Literary Festival — Kedar Mishra','https://kalingaliteraryfestival.com/speakers/kedar-mishra/',['Sonepur origins; Odia poet, translator, editor and art critic; collections; classical arts and Odissi scripts']),source('OdishaBytes — Rabindra Swain on This Country Is Not Mine','https://odishabytes.com/contemporary-odia-poet-kedar-mishra-makes-a-mark-with-protest-poetry-in-this-country-is-not-mine/',['Named critic reviews collection, identifying Black Eagle Books as publisher and discussing love and dissent'])],books=[dict(title='This Country Is Not Mine',detail='Poetry · book review by Rabindra Swain',url='https://odishabytes.com/contemporary-odia-poet-kedar-mishra-makes-a-mark-with-protest-poetry-in-this-country-is-not-mine/')],identity_match='Odia poet, birth year 1972 and editor/translator/art-critic roles in festival profile agree with capture; book review corroborates literary identity.',poems_read=[dict(id=134,title='ଆଖି : ସତ୍ୟାଗ୍ରହ',basis='Full source read: eyes, Mahabharata motifs, anti-war lover, tears, shelter, freedom and satyagraha.')],limitations=['Undated festival profile may reflect older appointments; no current editorial title or total book count asserted.','Close reading is interpretive, not a claim of personal biography or political affiliation.','Book card links a clearly labelled review, not a purchase page; translator credit not inferred.'],next_action='Independent author/editor factual and literary review.'))
